ason=2027) print(ids.height) # Skip the files written ahead of a game (a few hundred bytes) ids.filter(pl.col(\"size\") > 2000)","s":"elh_game_ids","u":"/docs/elh/reference/additional","h":"#elh_game_ids","p":9338},{"i":9344,"t":"sportsdataverse.hockey.elh — 8 endpoints.","s":"Czech Extraliga — Czech Extraliga (hokej.cz S3 bucket + eSports Media scoreboard)","u":"/docs/elh/reference/elh","h":"","p":9343},{"i":9346,"t":"Cumulative shot attempts and shots on goal of one game, per team and game minute. Endpoint URL: GET https://s3-eu-west-1.amazonaws.com/hokej.cz/visualization/events/{match_id}.json Valid URL: https://s3-eu-west-1.amazonaws.com/hokej.cz/visualization/events/2928321.json","s":"elh_events","u":"/docs/elh/reference/elh","h":"#elh_events","p":9343},{"i":9348,"t":"return_parsed=True (default) — a tidy polars.DataFrame with the columns below; pass return_as_pandas=True for a pandas.DataFrame. return_parsed=False — the raw JSON Dict payload, unparsed.","s":"Returns","u":"/docs/elh/reference/elh","h":"#elh_events-returns","p":9343},{"i":9351,"t":"elh_events(match_id=2928321)","s":"Example","u":"/docs/elh/reference/elh","h":"#elh_events-example","p":9343},{"i":9353,"t":"One page (up to 1,000 keys) of the hokej.cz S3 bucket listing; match keys carry the hokej.cz game id. The bucket is not Extraliga-only. Endpoint URL: GET https://s3-eu-west-1.amazonaws.com/hokej.cz/ Valid URL: https://s3-eu-west-1.amazonaws.com/hokej.cz/?prefix=match%2F2026%2Ffull%2F&max-keys=3","s":"elh_list_objects","u":"/docs/elh/reference/elh","h":"#elh_list_objects","p":9343},{"i":9355,"t":"return_parsed=True (default) — a tidy polars.DataFrame with the columns below; pass return_as_pandas=True for a pandas.DataFrame. return_parsed=False — the raw ListObjects V1 XML page as text (str).","s":"Returns","u":"/docs/elh/reference/elh","h":"#elh_list_objects-returns","p":9343},{"i":9358,"t":"elh_list_objects(max_keys='3', prefix='match/2026/full/')","s":"Example","u":"/docs/elh/reference/elh","h"